          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "06:30 A.M. Shift Begins"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6b46411afe0a7274"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "System check complete. Energy at 100%, sensors operating normally. Linking to venue surveillance system."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Commencing patrol on designated route. Foot traffic steady, all clear."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4412b760ec033677"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "==============================================="
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1548725cd2ccab4f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "09:30 A.M. Incident 001"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Description"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": 2 visitors attempted to climb the Great Septimus stand without any safety measures in place."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Response Measures"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Relevant warnings have been issued, and large set props such as stands have been added to the priority patrol list."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4b67c4ad4b858146"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "09:30 A.M. Incident 002"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Description"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": One artist, live-sketching an imagenae version of the \"Origami Bird\" at their booth, drew massive crowds of bird-watchers and photographers, causing severe traffic congestion."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Response Measures"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Crowds promptly dispersed and visitors organized into orderly queues."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d90bd4d41c7b53a8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "09:30 A.M. Incident 123"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Description"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": 8 visitors misused on-site self-service SoulGlad machines in an attempt to organize a \"SoulGlad Splash Festival,\" resulting in contamination of portions of the venue and affecting nearby pedestrians and stalls."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Response Measures"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Temporarily detained the individuals involved for conduct and safety education, and finalized a compensation plan."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-76602128d93aed93"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "08:35 P.M. Incident 124"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Description"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": 13 cosplayers attempted to draw a large magic summoning circle in the center of the venue to recreate the \"Holy Grail War.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Response Measures"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Relevant education on proper conduct has been administered, and the perpetrators have been supervised in cleaning up their graffiti from the floor."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1c9b01ae778e1da6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "09:35 P.M. Incident 233"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Description"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": A total of 35 visitors and cosplayers gathered around the Great Septimus stand before closing time, attempting to organize a \"Harmonious Choir\" summoning ceremony."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Response Measures"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ": Crowd was promptly dispersed and the area cleared. No stampede incidents occurred."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e8a618d9157b2d1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "==============================================="
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1548725cd2ccab4f-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "10:00 A.M. Shift Complete"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Shift Summary:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "233 incidents handled today. No injuries or major property damage."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Venue cleared. System enters standby maintenance state."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d88d40c848a0d540"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Unofficial Record:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Mechatron Expletive]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Power remaining at 15%, consumption 250% higher than expected."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-13c3c5de0669ab92"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "---End of Log Record---"
              }
            ],
